error BYN2615: a panic handler reads `ys`, which is moved after the handler is registered

  9 │     sink(move ys);
    │          ^^^^^^^ the `defer panicking` on line 8 reads it after a later panic
    │
  help: move `ys` before the `defer panicking`, or read a `let` copied from it there

